==================================================  
                      HEALTH SYMPTOM ANALYZER
           Applied Machine Learning Project (COEN 691) - Fall 2025
========================================================================

PROJECT OVERVIEW
----------------
This project is an end-to-end Machine Learning pipeline designed to predict 
potential diseases based on a user's symptoms. It utilizes an Ensemble 
Voting Classifier (combining Random Forest, SVM, Naive Bayes, and others) 
to ensure high accuracy and robust predictions. The system is deployed as 
a real-time web application using Streamlit.

TEAM MEMBERS
